    "找不到主机，请检查服务器地址（IP / 主机名 / .local）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host not found. Check the server address (IP / hostname / .local)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到主機，請檢查伺服器地址（IP / 主機名 / .local）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "插件返回失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plugin returned an error"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件返回失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法安全保存音乐库，请检查可用空间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not safely save the music library. Check available space and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法安全儲存音樂庫，請檢查可用空間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法访问服务器，请检查地址、网络和服务状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot reach the server. Check the address, network, and server status."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法訪問伺服器，請檢查地址、網路和服務狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法访问系统 Keychain，请解锁设备后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot access the system Keychain. Unlock your device and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法訪問系統 Keychain，請解鎖裝置後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法访问系统 Keychain（可能被锁定或签名受限）。请解锁 Mac 后重试；测试连接使用内存凭据，不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot access the system Keychain (it may be locked or signature-limited). Unlock your Mac and try again; connection tests use in-memory credentials and are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法訪問系統 Keychain（可能被鎖定或簽名受限）。請解鎖 Mac 後重試；測試連線使用內存憑證，不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法连接到服务器（服务器可能未启动或拒绝连接）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot connect to the server (it may not be running or may be refusing connections)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法連線到伺服器（伺服器可能未啟動或拒絕連線）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
