    "服务器地址不能内嵌用户名或密码（如 user:pass@host）。请把用户名与密码填写在对应输入框。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server address cannot embed a username or password (e.g. user:pass@host). Enter the username and password in the corresponding fields."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器地址不能內嵌用戶名或密碼（如 user:pass@host）。請把用戶名與密碼填寫在对應輸入框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
